MAIN
MOVE TEMP 12 4
MOVE TEMP 13 HALLOCATE TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 14 8
MOVE TEMP 15 HALLOCATE TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 16 A_cond
HSTORE TEMP 6 4 TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 17 A_start
HSTORE TEMP 6 0 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 TEMP 6
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 0
MOVE TEMP 19 CALL TEMP 8 ( TEMP 4 )
PRINT TEMP 19
END
A_start [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 20 0
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 20
L0 MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 9 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 4
MOVE TEMP 21 5
MOVE TEMP 22 CALL TEMP 11 ( TEMP 9 TEMP 1 TEMP 21 )
CJUMP TEMP 22 L1
MOVE TEMP 23 1
MOVE TEMP 24 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 25 1
PRINT TEMP 25
JUMP L0
L1  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 26 0

RETURN TEMP 26
END
A_cond [ 3 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 27 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 2
CJUMP TEMP 27 L2
MOVE TEMP 28 1
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 28
JUMP L3
L2 MOVE TEMP 29 0
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 29
L3  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 30 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2
PRINT TEMP 30

RETURN TEMP 3
END

